@startuml sequence_reviewer_workload
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15

title Sequence Diagram: Reviewer Workload Snapshot

participant "GitHub REST API" as GitHub
participant "FastAPI Sync" as API
database "review_events" as Events
participant "Workload Analyzer" as Model
participant "React Dashboard" as UI

API -> GitHub : GET /pulls/{number}/reviews
GitHub --> API : Reviewer, state, submitted_at
API -> Events : Upsert review event by GitHub review ID
API -> Model : Analyze events grouped by reviewer
Model -> Model : For each event, find other PRs\npreviously reviewed by reviewer
Model -> Model : Keep PRs open at event timestamp
Model --> API : First-review workload, rounds,\nlatency correlation, slope
API --> UI : workload_summary + PR metrics
UI --> UI : Render queue metric and audit report

note right of Model
Workload is a transparent queue-congestion proxy,
not a claim about private assignment state.
end note

@enduml
